 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.38,
   "end": 1.79,
   "text": "In 1993,"
  },
  {
   "start": 1.81,
   "end": 2.698,
   "text": "investors told him"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.718,
   "end": 4.53,
   "text": "video games weren't a market."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.66,
   "end": 5.631,
   "text": "His mother asked why"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.651,
   "end": 7.24,
   "text": "he didn't just get a job."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.58,
   "end": 9.68,
   "text": "Sixteen years later, at Stanford,"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.7,
   "end": 10.795,
   "text": "Jensen Huang explained"
  },
  {
   "start": 10.815,
   "end": 12.23,
   "text": "how he got past that."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.35,
   "end": 13.31,
   "text": "Lesson one:"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.33,
   "end": 15.2,
   "text": "don't wait for a grand vision."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.3,
   "end": 16.87,
   "text": "Everyone has a perspective."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.89,
   "end": 18.49,
   "text": "That's all a vision really is."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.75,
   "end": 20.086,
   "text": "His perspective in 1993:"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.106,
   "end": 20.99,
   "text": "take 3D graphics"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.01,
   "end": 22.516,
   "text": "off expensive workstations,"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.536,
   "end": 23.68,
   "text": "make them cheap,"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.7,
   "end": 25.277,
   "text": "and let video games pull"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.297,
   "end": 27.51,
   "text": "the whole PC market forward."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.74,
   "end": 28.83,
   "text": "Lesson two:"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.85,
   "end": 29.54,
   "text": "sometimes you go"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.56,
   "end": 30.93,
   "text": "against your customers."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.01,
   "end": 32.676,
   "text": "Dell, HP, IBM and Gateway"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.696,
   "end": 34.72,
   "text": "all said it cost too much."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.74,
   "end": 35.992,
   "text": "He still bet the company's"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.012,
   "end": 37.263,
   "text": "last few million on a chip"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.283,
   "end": 38.63,
   "text": "that was far too big,"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.65,
   "end": 39.528,
   "text": "sure the technology"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.548,
   "end": 40.89,
   "text": "would get cheap fast."
  },
  {
   "start": 41.17,
   "end": 42.473,
   "text": "About two hundred companies"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.493,
   "end": 43.9,
   "text": "went after 3D graphics."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.92,
   "end": 45.342,
   "text": "Money, talent and technology"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.362,
   "end": 46.64,
   "text": "were roughly equal."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.66,
   "end": 47.94,
   "text": "What decided who survived,"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.96,
   "end": 49.24,
   "text": "he said, was understanding"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.26,
   "end": 50.81,
   "text": "why your business works."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.06,
   "end": 52.0,
   "text": "Lesson three:"
  },
  {
   "start": 52.02,
   "end": 53.8,
   "text": "get comfortable with ambiguity."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.82,
   "end": 55.59,
   "text": "Leaders don't have to be outgoing."
  },
  {
   "start": 55.61,
   "end": 56.516,
   "text": "They do have to act"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.536,
   "end": 58.25,
   "text": "before the outcome is clear."
  },
  {
   "start": 58.34,
   "end": 59.3,
   "text": "Lesson four:"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.32,
   "end": 61.1,
   "text": "tear it down and rebuild."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.16,
   "end": 62.92,
   "text": "Every success has to be rebuilt,"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.94,
   "end": 64.3,
   "text": "roughly once a decade."
  },
  {
   "start": 64.36,
   "end": 65.211,
   "text": "If you don't replace"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.231,
   "end": 65.952,
   "text": "your own product,"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.972,
   "end": 67.28,
   "text": "your competitors will."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.31,
   "end": 67.718,
   "text": "Finally:"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.738,
   "end": 69.699,
   "text": "skill, intellect and training matter,"
  },
  {
   "start": 69.719,
   "end": 71.3,
   "text": "but they're not enough."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.35,
   "end": 72.019,
   "text": "You need passion"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.039,
   "end": 72.923,
   "text": "for the painful parts"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.943,
   "end": 74.2,
   "text": "of building a company."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.22,
   "end": 75.88,
   "text": "Which lesson do you need most?"
  },
  {
   "start": 75.9,
   "end": 77.14,
   "text": "Tell me in the comments."
  }
 ],
